Z||000002||fierodave||08-12-2000||01:43 AM||||One other word of caution here folks,<BR>and this is not because i am a seller of items,  this info everyone needs to know!!  YOU all need to REQUEST IF you do sign up, that you be placed on the "DO NOT SELL LIST" this will keep them from selling your personal info to third party interested Co's<P>You should also call up the 800 numbers on all your credit cards too! and request this be done to all your accounts. <P>If they tell you they don't sell there lists #1 there lying #2 why would they have them, if they didn't sell them? #3 if they claim they don't have a sell list, ask them if they borrow the lists to there sister companys,  request this list and your request to be removed from the list be sent to you in written form, If they refuse or do not comply, you can sue them in small claims court for $500.00 and win. :~)<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://members.theglobe.com/fierodave/gifs/fierosig.gif"> ||||reg||1
